## Acceptance criteria

- Blobs keep moving without pointer activity and retain all placed scoop records.
- Only some forms have tapered peaks; rounded forms remain in the composition.
- No hard inner height clamp creating broad flat tops.
- Pause freezes all motion/paint; hidden/inactive/forced-colour/print stops rendering.
- Active visible motion has a30fps ceiling; no catch-up jump after inactivity.
- Existing resolution budget,18stored-scoop limit and static fallback remain.
- No new image-tool views; owner liking the old study does not approve this new
  revision or authorize production integration.

